title: "Maxey0 Context Plane"
abstract: "A map of where a task belongs and who should handle it (Domain, Topic, Concept, Skill, MaxeyN agents, MCP servers), served as a read-only MCP server and drawn as an interactive 3D graph app. Builds on Structured Context Windows (SCW), first published by the author on 27 September 2025."
